  m_Name: wren
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Voidborne::Voidborne.NPCs.NpcDefinition
  id: wren
  displayName: Wren
  description: 'The first Kin you rescue (M6 / Act 1). Quiet for most of Act 1; the
    moral hinge of Act 3 in later milestones. For M6 acceptance: she follows the
    player home from the M6 stronghold encounter, lives at the base, and comments
    on the player''s discoveries via the Spirit Gateway link.'
  section: Kin Survivors
  behaviors:
  - Follows the player back to base after rescue.
  - Speaks short hand-authored lines at scripted moments.
  - Stays at the base.
  - Reads the Discovery Log and comments on weird synergies.
  abilities:
  - Provides hand-authored dialog at base.
  - Gates the Spirit Gateway unlock (M6 final step).
  dropOrTradeItems:
  - Cannot be killed by player.
  isKillable: 0
  isQuestGiver: 1
